<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Key Facts — {{.SiteName}}</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/styles.css">
    <script src="js/nav.js" defer></script>
    {{template "head-og" .}}
</head>
<body>

    {{template "nav" .}}

    <main class="resources-page">
        <h1>Key Facts</h1>
        <p>Whether you are a parent researching a decision, a healthcare professional, or simply curious, this page brings together the most important factual resources in one place.</p>

        <div class="get-involved-nav">
            <a href="#written-resources" class="get-involved-nav-link">Written Resources</a>
            <a href="#informative-resources" class="get-involved-nav-link">Informative Resources</a>
        </div>

        <section class="resource-section" id="written-resources">
            <h2>Written Resources</h2>
            <p>Intact Global maintains a concise, evidence-based summary covering what genital cutting is, why it is performed, and the medical and ethical arguments against it. A good starting point for anyone new to the topic.</p>
            <a href="https://www.intactglobal.org/about/facts" target="_blank" class="resource-link-btn">Read the facts from Intact Global</a>
        </section>

        <section class="resource-section" id="informative-resources">
            <h2>Informative Resources</h2>
            <p><strong>Child Circumcision: An Elephant in the Hospital</strong> — Ryan McAllister PhD presents a clear, science-based examination of infant circumcision, covering anatomy, function, risk, and the ethical questions surrounding consent.</p>
            <div class="video-embed">
                <iframe
                    src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/zZ9j83kRYdE"
                    title="Child Circumcision: An Elephant in the Hospital — Ryan McAllister PhD"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
                    allowfullscreen>
                </iframe>
            </div>
        </section>

        <a href="#" class="back-to-top">&#8679; Top</a>
    </main>

    {{template "footer" .}}

</body>
</html>
